            </div>
            <div class="subject-benefit__section"><el-collapse><el-collapse-item title="会员外观与卡面" name="visual"><div class="member-visual-editor">
                <div class="member-visual-preview"><div class="member-visual-card" :style="visualPreviewStyle"><img v-if="visualPreviewImage" :src="visualPreviewImage" class="member-visual-card__image" alt="卡面背景预览" /><div class="member-visual-card__content"><span class="member-visual-card__eyebrow">会员外观预览</span><strong>门店会员</strong><span class="member-visual-card__caption">等级卡面与商户标识使用同一套配色</span><div class="member-visual-card__bottom"><span class="member-visual-avatar" :class="{'has-effect':draft.visual.avatar_effect}" :style="{'--member-accent':visualPreview.accent_color}">店</span><span class="member-visual-badge">会员标识</span></div></div></div><p class="subject-benefit__hint">{{ draft.visual.preset==='auto'?'自动模式此处用中性色示意；保存后按实际等级顺序配色。':'预览仅展示外观，不代表已获得会员权益。' }}</p></div>
                <div class="member-visual-fields"><div class="member-visual-preset"><el-select v-model="visualPresetChoice" aria-label="会员外观配色预设"><el-option v-for="item in subjectVisualPresets" :key="item.key" :label="item.name" :value="item.key" /></el-select><el-button @click="applyVisualPreset">应用配色</el-button></div><p class="subject-benefit__hint">点击应用才填入颜色，保留卡面图片、渐变方向和头像效果。手动改色后切换为自定义。</p>
                    <div v-for="field in visualFields" :key="field.key" class="member-visual-field"><label>{{ field.label }}</label><el-color-picker :model-value="draft.visual[field.key]" color-format="hex" :aria-label="field.label" @update:model-value="patchVisual(field.key,$event||'')" /><el-input :model-value="draft.visual[field.key]" placeholder="#RRGGBB" maxlength="7" :aria-label="field.label+'十六进制值'" @update:model-value="patchVisual(field.key,$event)" /></div>
                    <div class="member-visual-field"><label>渐变方向</label><el-input-number :model-value="draft.visual.angle" :min="0" :max="360" :precision="0" controls-position="right" aria-label="渐变角度0到360度" @update:model-value="patchVisual('angle',$event)" /><span>°</span></div>
                    <div class="member-visual-field member-visual-field--upload"><label>卡面图片</label><UploadImage :model-value="draft.visual.card_image" :limit="1" @update:model-value="patchVisual('card_image',$event)" /></div>
                    <el-collapse class="member-cover-library"><el-collapse-item title="选择主题卡面" name="covers"><el-radio-group v-model="coverFormat" size="small" aria-label="卡面素材格式"><el-radio-button label="png">静态 PNG</el-radio-button><el-radio-button label="gif">流光 GIF</el-radio-button></el-radio-group><div class="member-cover-grid"><button v-for="cover in subjectCoverThemes" :key="cover.key" type="button" :class="{'is-chosen':draft.visual.card_image===subjectCoverPath(cover.key,coverFormat)}" :aria-label="'应用'+cover.name+'主题封面及配色'" @click="applyCover(cover.key)"><img :src="img(subjectCoverPath(cover.key,'png'))" :alt="cover.name+'封面'" /><span>{{ cover.name }}</span></button></div><p class="subject-benefit__hint">点击卡面应用对应配色；保存会员等级后生效。GIF为轻流光，可随时改用静态版。</p></el-collapse-item></el-collapse>
                    <div class="member-visual-field"><label>头像效果</label><el-switch :model-value="draft.visual.avatar_effect" active-text="显示等级外观" aria-label="显示商户头像等级效果" @update:model-value="patchVisual('avatar_effect',$event)" /></div>
                    <p class="subject-benefit__hint">卡面图片选填，移除后使用渐变。颜色、卡面与头像效果仅控制展示，不影响费用、经验门槛或协作权限。</p>
